.nh
.TH "PB-TEAM-LIST" "1" "Sep 2026" "Paperboat" "Paperboat CLI"

.SH NAME
pb-team-list - List teams


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBpb team list [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
List the teams this account belongs to, one line each: team ID, owner account and current
generation, sorted by team ID. Use pb team get for members, grants and machines.

.PP
JSON output is supported with --json.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for list

.PP
\fB--json\fP[=false]
	print canonical JSON


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--config\fP=""
	path to the CLI config file

.PP
\fB--no-customization\fP[=false]
	ignore local shortcuts, command defaults, and TUI preferences

.PP
\fB--server\fP=""
	paperboat-server base URL override

.PP
\fB--workspace\fP=""
	resource workspace selector: personal or a team slug


.SH EXAMPLE
.EX
  pb team list
  pb team list --json
.EE


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBpb-team(1)\fP
